# Hot reload with no reload-aware code (spec 031 AC-4b): the sprites example's hero.png is swapped for another image
# (the tile atlas) and the very next frame draws the hero from it. Screenshots before and after; the PNG is put back
# when the script ends.
fail-on "] E "
wait 30
screenshot before
swap-asset assets/art/hero.png fixtures/hero_swapped.png
expect-reload art/hero
screenshot after
wait 5
end
